+# Corpus fetching
+
+The corpus fetch had to respect Svipall's per-domain limit of **12 visits per
+60-second window**. Breaching that limit imposed a **900-second (15-minute)
+cooldown** for the affected domain.
+
+Files were fetched through these hosts:
+
+- `raw.githubusercontent.com` (the primary raw-file host)
+- `cdn.jsdelivr.net`, using URLs of the form
+  `cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/owner/repo@branch/path`
+- `cdn.statically.io` (used as a mirror, although it was slow and sometimes
+  timed out)
